Build the core integration framework that transforms MotoGateway from a
single-purpose converter into a generic integration platform.

New modules:
- app/core/integration.py — Integration model, config schema, runner,
  source/destination/transform registries
- app/core/transform.py — Declarative mapping engine with dot-path
  navigation, date/lookup/string transforms, array iteration
- app/core/source_manager.py — File source readers (CSV, TSV, JSON, XML)
  with auto-detection by extension
- app/core/dest_manager.py — File destination writers (JSON, XML, CSV)
  with dict-to-XML conversion
- app/builtin/tecom_integration.py — Wraps existing TECOM builder as a
  "custom" transform integration
- app/builtin/ordrsp_integration.py — Wraps existing OrdRsp builder the
  same way

Modified:
- app/engine.py — Registers builtins at startup; adds process_integration()
  for user-created integrations; legacy process_file() path unchanged
- app/config.py — Adds integrations[] to config schema with CRUD functions
- app/watcher.py — IntegrationHandler watches user-created integration dirs

Tests: 40 new tests covering model, transform, source, destination,
registration, config CRUD, and end-to-end CSV→mapping→JSON pipeline.
All existing behavior preserved — zero changes to FORMAT_HANDLERS path.

